Hi Vishnu,
the date format differs between session 1 and 2. In session 1, "installed" and "removed" columns are dates, in session 2 they are date-times.
You then specify  dateFormat   = "%Y - %m - %d" , so session 2 would not be recognised. The ususal warnings / error messages don't catch this because it is correct for session 1. On a side note, I'd remove the spaces from the dateFormat argument, I'm surprised it works at all. Or use the lubridate specification: dateFormat = "ymd"
Also, the next release of camtrapR will support date-times for setup / retrieval / problem columns, but the current version on CRAN does not yet.
Best regards,
Jürgen

